Build a complete website for the following brief with layout: timeline.

<content_brief>
  <business_name>Neon Sound Festival</business_name>
  <tagline>3 Nights of Immersive Electronic and Holographic Music</tagline>
  <business_type>festival</business_type>
  <layout_archetype>timeline</layout_archetype>
  <layout_guidelines>Vertical sequential timeline or milestone track with connecting spine lines, step indicators, alternating dates/milestones, and progressive node highlights.</layout_guidelines>
  <motion_guidelines>Timeline Motion: Implement sequential reveal of milestone nodes as they scroll into view via IntersectionObserver, with connecting-line draw-in animation (transform: scaleY(0) -> scaleY(1)). Mandatory reduced-motion fallback: @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .timeline__node, .timeline__line-fill { opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; transition: none !important; } }</motion_guidelines>
  <primary_color>#090814</primary_color>
  <accent_color>#06b6d4</accent_color>
  <font_heading>Space Grotesk</font_heading>
  <font_body>Inter</font_body>
  <sections>header, hero, stages, footer</sections>
  <item name="The Cyber Dome" tag="Stage 01" description="360-degree spatial L-Acoustics array with real-time reactive AI visual projections and synthwave headliners." />
  <item name="Subterranean Bass Hall" tag="Stage 02" description="Industrial warehouse acoustics engineered for heavy analog sub-bass, experimental dubstep, and glitch art." />
  <item name="Solstice Outdoor Arena" tag="Stage 03" description="Open-air lakeside amphitheater for sunset melodic techno, live orchestral electronica, and drone shows." />
  <item name="Ambient Chill Sanctuary" tag="Stage 04" description="Binaural meditation dome with zero-gravity hammocks, herbal elixir bars, and modular synth live jams." />
  <contact>
    <address>Desert Oasis Grounds, Indio, CA 92201</address>
    <phone>+1 (760) 555-0195</phone>
    <email>tickets@neonsoundfest.com</email>
    <hours>Festival Dates: October 16–18, 2026 | Gates Open 2pm Daily</hours>
  </contact>
</content_brief>

You will build the site ONE SECTION AT A TIME. Start with the first section now.

FIRST SECTION REQUIRED: Write the Header section: a sticky navigation bar with the business name/logo on the left, navigation links (Home, Headlining Stages, Contact) on the right, plus 'Buy Festival Passes' CTA button. Files: src/components/Header.tsx + src/components/Header.css

