FIRST SECTION REQUIRED: Write the Header section: a sticky navigation bar with the business name/logo on the left, navigation links (Home, Print Formats, Contact) on the right, plus 'Order Print Run' CTA button. Files: src/components/Header.tsx + src/components/Header.css

